# Captured HAR files. These are recordings of a real logged-in Facebook session: they
# carry session tokens, and the names, profile URLs and comment text of real people who
# never agreed to be in this repository. Read the doc_ids out of them, put those in
# fbRecipe.ts, and leave the recording on the machine that made it.
